          "_name": "features13",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features12\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Items\" name=\"items\" min=\"1\" max=\"3\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Icon Size\" name=\"iconSize\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">        \n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bg-2.png\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#01264d\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">        \n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <!--<div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-12 schedule-header\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-heading\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">                        \n                        <span class=\"mbri-calendar\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5 date-schedule\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>HỘI NGHỊ VIỆT NAM XUẤT SẮC 2025</b></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>-->\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-12 schedule-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">                                          \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><span><b>5:00 P.M</b></span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Welcome &amp; Networking</b></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">                                          \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><span><b>5:45 PM</b></span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Opening session</b></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>6:00 PM</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">  \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Anphabe’s exclusive report: THE GREAT SHUFFLE – FROM CHAOS TO CLARITY</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">2025 began with intense disruption: large-scale restructuring, fast-moving talent shifts, and a race among businesses to become leaner — not just to survive, but to rise above. And at the center of this turning point? Human Resources. No longer just supporting change — but driving it forward.</p>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">This report explores the key trends shaping the future of work:</p>\n                         <ul class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                          <li>From reducing costs → to strengthening capabilities</li>\n                          <li>From solving skill shortages → to addressing deeper capability gaps</li>\n                          <li>From managing people → to creating a future-ready talent ecosystem</li>\n                         </ul>\n\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Inspired by the idea of “More with Fewer,” this report is more than just data — it’s your essential guide to leading through change: Clear insights; Bold strategies; Practical tools to help you stay ahead in the evolving talent landscape.<br><br><b>Are you ready to move from reacting — to leading with purpose?</b><br></p>\n\n                        <div class=\"schedule-speakers mb-4\">\n                            <div class=\"speaker-title\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <b>Speaker</b></p>\n                            </div>\n                            <ul class=\"speaker-list\">\n                                <li>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/thanh-nguyen.jpg\" alt=\"Thanh Nguyễn\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Ms.&nbsp;<b style>THANH NGUYỄN</b><br><i>CEO &amp; Chief Happiness Officer\n</i><div><i>Anphabe</i></div></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                           \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">                                          \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><span><b>7:00 P.M</b></span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>AnphaTalk: Innovation in the age of AI</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">As AI rapidly transforms the way we work, innovate, and lead, organizations must reimagine how they build skills, design roles, and unlock human potential. This session explores key talent shifts, the synergy between people and technology, and actionable strategies to drive innovation and agility in the AI era.</p>\n                        <div class=\"schedule-speakers mb-4\">\n                            <div class=\"speaker-title\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <b>Speaker</b></p>\n                            </div>\n                            <ul class=\"speaker-list\">\n                                <li>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/20250410-140923.jpeg\" alt>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Mr.&nbsp;<b>KUNAL MALHOTRA</b><br><i>Country Manager (Vietnam and Korea)<br>LinkedIn</i></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                           \n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><i>Kunal Malhotra leads the Talent Solutions business in Southeast Asia and is the Country Manager for Korea &amp; Vietnam. He is based in Singapore and has been with LinkedIn for 10+ years now, making him one of the most tenured employees at LinkedIn APAC..<br>\n<br>Kunal Malholtra is passionate about helping organizations embrace AI solutions to address their talent management needs globally.&nbsp;He believes in LinkedIn’s vision of creating economic opportunity and strives to do his part by speaking and working with professionals to realize their dream jobs. </i><br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">                        \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>7:15 PM</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                     <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Awards ceremony: Vietnam Excellence® 2025</b><div><b>- Leadership Excellence 2025\n</b><div><b>- HR Excellence 2025</b></div></div></h5>       \n                        <!--<ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".list\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li><b>NHÂN SỰ XUẤT SẮC 2025</b></li>\n                            <li><b>LÃNH ĐẠO XUẤT SẮC 2025</b></li>\n                        </ul>-->\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><i>Anphabe’s Certification Program VIETNAM EXCELLENCE® honors leaders and businesses who demonstrated excellence and impact across the organizations in transforming business through talent &amp; workplace development. In return, they will also serve as role models and accelerate their betterment through practice, knowledge sharing and leadership mentoring for the business community.</i></p>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><i>Be part of a meaningful celebration with our trusted Advisory Board - honoring Excellence Leaders and HR Teams, and tap into their proven practices and get inspired to apply new ideas that can drive real impact on your organization.</i></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                \n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">                        \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>7:30 PM</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Gala Dinner</b></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex  item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>8:15 PM</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Celebration Photo Session</b></h5>   \n                        <!--<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">7 dự đoán từ Linkedin, mạng cộng đồng nghề nghiệp lớn nhất thế giới về tương lai của tuyển dụng và các chuyển đỏi chiến lược trong thu hút và giữ chân nhân tài.</p>                         \n                        <div class=\"schedule-speakers mb-4\">\n                            <div class=\"speaker-title\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <b>Diễn giả</b>\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <ul class=\"speaker-list\">\n                                <li>      \n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/eddy.png\" alt=\"Céline Nhã Nguyễn\">\n                                    </div>                              \n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        \n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Ông<b> EDDYMAN KHARMA</b><br><i>Giám đốc đối tác chiến lược<br>LinkedIn</i></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>-->\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!--<div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">        \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>20:00</b></p>\n                    </div>                    \n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Phiên thảo luận</b><br><b>CHĂM SÓC NHÂN VIÊN: \"NƯỚC CỜ\" THAY ĐỔI CUỘC CHƠI</b></h5>  \n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Với tinh thần hướng tới chăm sóc nhân viên, hãy cùng tìm hiểu và học hỏi thêm những cách thức chăm sóc hiệu quả hơn, thiết thực hơn để tối ưu trải nghiệm và gắn kết cho nhân viên – “vũ khí” quan trọng nhất trong mọi “nước cờ” tại doanh nghiệp bạn.</p>                      \n                        <div class=\"schedule-speakers mb-4\">\n                            <div class=\"speaker-title\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <b>Diễn giả</b>\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <ul class=\"speaker-list\">\n                                <li>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/phu-xuan.jpg\" alt=\"Phú Xuân\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                            Bà <b style>TRẦN HOÀNG PHÚ XUÂN</b><br><i>Sáng lập &amp; CEO Faslink Group</i><br><i>Phó Chủ tịch Hội Dệt May Thêu Đan </i><br><i>Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh</i></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                                <li>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/thu-hoa.jpg\" alt=\"Thu Hòa\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                            Bà <b>NGUYỄN THỊ THU HÒA</b><br><i>Tổng Giám Đốc - ADP Group</i></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                                <li>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/nguyenanhhung.jpg\" alt=\"Nguyen Anh Hung\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Mr. <b>NGUYỄN ANH HÙNG</b><br><i>Nhà sáng lập, Tổng Giám Đốc - CBVGroup</i><br><i>\nCố vấn cao cấp – PNJ Group</i></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                           \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>--> \n\n                \n\n            </div>\n        </div>        \n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
